      "title": "ASN.1 Dissectors: Add missing EXPORT_DEPENDS",
      "message": "ASN.1 Dissectors: Add missing EXPORT_DEPENDS\n\nThis eliminates warnings on a fresh build like\n\n:0: UserWarning: Missing tag information for imported type Name from InformationFramework (InformationFramework)\n\nwhich come from building {proto}-exp.cnf for a protocol that exports\ntypes which contain types imported from other protocols. It allows\nCMake to determine the correct build order.\n\nYes, there is a DAG. No, there might not be a DAG in the future.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
